## Specification Analysis Report

**Feature**: `specs/020-session-win32-direct-launch` (X-8). I read spec.md, plan.md, tasks.md, data-model.md, research.md, contracts/ipc-win32-claude.md, quickstart.md and AD-058 (proposed, untracked). I checked them against the constitution, the session charter and the glossary, and spot-checked `LaunchDialog.tsx`, `runtime-store.ts`, `launch-preparation.ts` and `win32.ts`. Nothing was modified. The prerequisite script was not run (Bash avoided as instructed). The paths were taken from the caller. No `before_analyze` / `after_analyze` hooks are registered in `.specify/extensions.yml`.

